<title>CHINA: EMPEROR (CHINA) YEAR NET LOSS HK$93.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>EMPEROR (CHINA) YEAR NET LOSS HK$93.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	  28.2 loss  vs 36.4 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)   nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	 33.34 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			   93.70 loss vs 110.31 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		    488.36     vs 937.41</p>
<p>    Company name		Emperor (China Concept) Investments</p>
<p>				    Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		 N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	  N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Emperor (China Concept) is a property and share investment company.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$19.80 million on write down of carrying value of a holiday resort and loss of HK$13.53 million on provision for advances and accrued interest receivable due from minority shareholders of a subsidiary.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
